OL,3,GNEWSA'Trains run through our
OL,4,Acommunities but none stop'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSomerset deserves new stations and a
OL,7,Frail line that "works in every season"
OL,8,Fone MP from the county has said.
OL,10,FGlastonbury and Somerton MP Sarah Dyke
OL,11,Ftold parliament that a "lack of
OL,12,Finvestment and planning" had left rural
OL,13,Fareas "cut off from the railway".
OL,15,FSpeaking at the House of Commons debate
OL,16,Fon Railway Infrastructure: South-West,
OL,17,Fshe said: "Trains run right through the
OL,18,Fheart of our communities but not one of
OL,19,Fthem stops. The Prime Minister wants
OL,20,Fgrowth in every postcode, but there
OL,21,Fwill be no growth in postcodes that
OL,22,Fcannot be reached."
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
